35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"I watched the mornings. Eleven bikes leave between seven and nine. Four times, someone had to shift another machine.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows little capital work. The ward park costs 2,600 yen monthly, with fourteen households waiting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The minutes show the same flats held covered spots for years. The sticker register shows varying bike counts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The complaint log has nine notes about leaning bikes. The neighbouring block had arrears and missed meetings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,The treasurer spends three hours a month on cash. The display frame takes twenty seconds to load and needs greasing.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if the ward park is full, we cannot just tell people to go there.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, correct. But the cost of a private space is high. We need to consider shared costs.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, the arrears at the neighbouring block are a warning. We must be careful with charges.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, yes. But the complaint log shows that without clear ownership, things get messy.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, the treasurer's time is already high. Adding more billing will be difficult.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The rain exposure is bad for the back row. We need to prioritize the dry spots.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The ledger is thin. Any major change needs a levy. We must be realistic.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,The sticker register shows some flats have three bikes. Equal claims are not equal needs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The neighbouring block's secretary said two households stopped coming to meetings. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"The display frame is heavy. If we use racks, someone must maintain them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"We need a solution that balances cost, fairness, and maintenance.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I propose we look at the options with these facts in mind.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I agree. The history shows we have been passive.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I agree. We need a clear rule to prevent future conflicts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,I agree. Let us see the options.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
