60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A charges monthly. Option B is shared racks. Option C is an annual lottery.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option A brings income, but the ledger is thin. Option B requires maintenance. Option C is simple.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,Option A might cause arrears like the neighbouring block. Option B is fair but messy. Option C is random.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A creates financial stress. Option B creates physical stress. Option C creates uncertainty.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A adds billing work. Option B adds physical work. Option C adds no work.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, Option A's income could fund the maintenance of Option B.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, that is a possibility. But the ward park cost is high. We need to be careful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, Option C might be the fairest, but it ignores the daily riders' needs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, the sticker register shows daily riders prefer paying. Option A might satisfy them.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, the treasurer's time is a concern. Option A adds to that.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I lean towards Option A, but with a cap on the charge.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Asuka. Option A is the most sustainable financially.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,I am hesitant about Option A. I prefer Option C for fairness.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I agree with George. Option C avoids the social friction of charges.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mio,,I agree with Shunichi. Option C is the least work for the association.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Let us vote. I will vote for Option A.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will vote for Option A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,George,,I will vote for Option C.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will vote for Option C.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Mio,,I will vote for Option C.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
